{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "25d30bea-6127-815c-861c-3f5bae7ec7df",
  "created_at": "2026-01-12T17:33:07-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Leila Okafor",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T17:29:54-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T17:29:58-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Denise. [pause] I know it's after five, City Hall's closed, I figured this was the line to try for after hours. I'm calling about the storm drain in front of my house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T17:30:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You've got the right line. What's going on with it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T17:30:16-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's gurgling. Just sitting there gurgling, and there's a sewer smell coming up out of it. It's been like that since the storm ended Saturday. Two days now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T17:30:28-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's not pleasant. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T17:30:32-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "34 Bellevue Avenue. Over in Bellevue, the drain's right at the curb out front."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T17:30:38-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 34 Bellevue. Is there water standing around it, or is it just the noise and the smell?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T17:30:46-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Some water pooling at the edge, yes. And the smell comes right into the front walk. [sighs] I had the door open this afternoon and had to shut it. It was not this bad last winter, I'll tell you that. We had storms, plenty of them, and it never did this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T17:31:06-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So it's something that's changed, then."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T17:31:10-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Definitely changed. So what I want to know is when somebody last came by to clean these out. Because I can't remember seeing anybody on this block in a long time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T17:31:23-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't have the cleaning dates in front of me on this line. I can put in a request for a crew to look at that drain and note that you're asking about the last service. Somebody can get back to you on that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T17:31:41-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please. I'd like an actual answer, not just a note in a file somewhere. I got my favorite sweater back from the cleaners today, finally, and I walked it up the front steps and the whole entrance smelled like a sewer. It's the kind of day I've had."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T17:32:00-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ugh, I'm sorry. Let's get this in so it's not a second thing to worry about. Can I get a callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T17:32:09-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0189."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T17:32:10-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "555-0189, area code 401. And that's Ms.... can you give me your last name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T17:32:16-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okafor. O-K-A-F-O-R. Leila."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T17:32:18-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Leila. I'm marking it as a backing-up, odor, standing water at the curb. After a storm like this the crews are stretched, so I can't give you the hour, but I'll flag it as a repeat complaint about the service history so they see you want that answer."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T17:32:38-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's not a repeat, I haven't called before. It's just that it's never been like this before. [pause] But fine, flag whatever gets somebody out here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T17:32:49-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood, I'll note it's new but serious. If the water starts coming toward the house or the street floods, call back right away."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T17:32:59-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. I'll be waiting. Thank you, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T17:33:03-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good night, Leila."
    }
  ],
